	<div class="card-background-white text-aligned-center">
		
		
		
		<div class="card-container one-card card-center card-theme4" data-cid="tcm:84-366328-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-223650-32">
			
				

	<div class="enhanced-txt-cm text-aligned-left" data-cid="tcm:84-366327-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-223644-32">

		<div>
			
			<div class="enhanced-txt-body">

				

				

				<div class="subheadline-regular" >If you live or are traveling outside the U.S., <a href="/help/international-access-codes/">call toll-free</a> from most countries. We accept all relay calls, including 711.</div>

				

				

				

				

				

				

			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

			
		</div>
		
	</div>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-366329-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">Checking or savings account, debit, or ATM card fraud</span>     
				<a href = "#CheckingorsavingsaccountdebitorATMcardfraud" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">Checking or savings account, debit, or ATM card fraud</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible"><p>Monitor your account activity and report anything suspicious right away.</p> <ul> <li>For personal accounts, call <span class="c12">1-800-869-3557</span>.</li> <li>For Business Banking Accounts, call <span class="c12">1-800-225-5935</span>.</li> </ul></div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-366330-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">Bill pay, Zelle<sup>®</sup><sup class="c20ref" data-footnote="tcm:702-164790-16" type="footnote"></sup>, direct pay, online transfers, ExpressSend<sup>®</sup><sup class="c20ref" data-footnote="tcm:84-365140-16" type="footnote"></sup>, and digital wire transactions</span>     
				<a href = "#BillpayZelledirectpayonlinetransfersExpressSendanddigitalwiretransactions" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">Bill pay, Zelle<sup>®</sup><sup class="c20ref" data-footnote="tcm:702-164790-16" type="footnote"></sup>, direct pay, online transfers, ExpressSend<sup>®</sup><sup class="c20ref" data-footnote="tcm:84-365140-16" type="footnote"></sup>, and digital wire transactions</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible"><ul> <li>If you suspect fraud on your account, including Wells Fargo Online<sup>®</sup> profile changes, call <span class="c12">1-866-867-5568</span>.</li> <li>Learn more about how to <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/bank-scams/online-payment-scams/">avoid online payment and wire transfer scams and fraud</a>.</li> </ul></div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-366331-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">Lost or stolen card</span>     
				<a href = "#Lostorstolencard" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">Lost or stolen card</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible"><ul> <li>If your Wells Fargo debit or credit card was damaged, lost, or stolen, visit <a href="https://connect.secure.wellsfargo.com/auth/login/present?origin=cob&serviceType=ReplaceCard" enrollmentid="0000">replace my card</a> to request a new one.</li> <li>If you suspect fraud or unauthorized transactions on your account and need to file a claim, please contact us immediately by calling the number on the back of your credit or debit card.</li> </ul></div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-366332-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">Suspicious emails or texts (phishing attempts)</span>     
				<a href = "#Suspiciousemailsortextsphishingattempts" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">Suspicious emails or texts (phishing attempts)</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible"><ul> <li>If you clicked a suspicious link, opened an attachment, sent a payment, shared one-time access codes, or provided personal financial information, call <span class="c12">1-866-867-5568</span>.</li> <li>If you did not respond, forward the suspicious email or text message to reportphish@wellsfargo.com.<sup class="c20ref" data-footnote="tcm:84-66770-16" type="footnote"></sup></li> <li>For more information, visit the <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/bank-scams/?linkLoc=nba">Avoid common bank and money scams</a> page.</li> </ul></div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-366333-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">Elder fraud</span>     
				<a href = "#Elderfraud" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">Elder fraud</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible"><ul> <li>If you are concerned that an elder adult or dependent has experienced any sort of suspicious activity or fraud related to their Wells Fargo accounts, call <span class="c12">1-800-869-3557</span> and we will assist you.</li> <li>For more information, visit the <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/bank-scams/elder-financial-scams/">Tips to avoid elder fraud and related scams</a> page.</li> </ul></div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-366334-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">Identity theft</span>     
				<a href = "#Identitytheft" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">Identity theft</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible"><ul> <li>Call <span class="c12">1-800-869-3557</span> if you believe you have experienced identity theft.</li> <li>View our <a href="/assets/pdf/personal/privacy-security/fraud/identity-theft-kit.pdf" refplatform="newwindow">Identity theft assistance kit (PDF)</a> for a helpful checklist of next steps.</li> <li>Learn more about how to <a href="/privacy-security/fraud/articles/data-breach-security/">help protect yourself after a fraud or security incident</a>.</li> </ul></div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-366335-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">Commercial account fraud</span>     
				<a href = "#Commercialaccountfraud" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">Commercial account fraud</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible"><ul> <li>If you suspect fraud on your commercial account in the US, Canada or Mexico, call <span class="c12">1-800-289-3557</span>.</li> <li>If calling from a country that supports UIFN (Universal International Freephone Number), dial the international dialing code and then UIFN phone number <span class="c12">800-289-3557</span>.</li> <li>For more information, visit <a href="/com/fraud/report-fraud/">report fraud on commercial accounts</a>.</li> </ul></div>
    </details>

	
		
    
    
    
    <details class="show-hide-content-wrapper" data-cid="tcm:182-366336-16" data-ctid="tcm:91-244416-32">
        
        <summary class="show-hide-content-title" aria-expanded="false" role="button">
			<span class="show-hide-title-text">
				<span class="hidden">Questions about open card claims</span>     
				<a href = "#Questionsaboutopencardclaims" aria-hidden = "true" tabindex = "-1">Questions about open card claims</a>			 
			</span>	
        </summary>
        
        <div class="show-hide-content-text-wrapper-collapsible"><ul> <li>Debit card claim status: You can review your status online, or call <span class="c12">1-800-548-9554</span>, Monday-Friday 7:00 a.m.-12:00 a.m. EST.</li> <li>Credit card claim status: You can call <span class="c12">1-800-423-7618</span>, Monday-Friday 7:00 a.m.-12:00 a.m. EST.</li> </ul></div>
    </details>

	
		
	<div class="card-background-white text-aligned-center">
		
		
		
